<title>USA: Merrill Md. receipts rated Aa/VMIG-1 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Merrill Md. receipts rated Aa/VMIG-1 by Moody's.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Sept 19 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 09/13/96.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Merrill Lynch Puttable Floating Option</p>
<p>Tax-Exempts Rec. Series PT-62 (relating to State of Maryland</p>
<p>Comm. Devel. Admin. Dept. of Hsg. &amp; Comm. Devel. Single Family</p>
<p>Prog.1995 second ser. 6.%, due 4-1-25) (Liquidity)</p>
